# Lean sources are per-checkout, not shared state. The workspace file the agent
# edits (WORKSPACE_NAME, default ConjectureProver.lean) is written by the harness
# at the start of every run and archived per run under
# experiment_runs/artifacts/<run_id>/, so tracking it only ever recorded scratch.
# The modules around it belong to the Lake scaffold, which is not tracked either
# (see lakefile.toml / lean-toolchain above). A fresh clone creates them; see
# "Building from a fresh clone" in README.md.
/*.lean
LeanWorkspace/input.lean

print.fls
print.aux
print.fdb_latexmk
print.log
.github
.vscode
.*
Notes/
graph_refactor_plan.md
LeanDAG/
mathlib4/

# Experiment harness output — regenerated on every run (see experiment_runs/README.md).
# results.csv / results.jsonl / report_stage*.md stay tracked as the study record.
experiment_runs/logs/
experiment_runs/artifacts/
experiment_runs/backup/
experiment_runs/summaries/